{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:25 2026-10-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:25 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:25 2026-10-28 HKT</p><img alt=\"伊波拉疫情傳至肯亞。 美聯社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2abfb4ffe94f98a354080dbc00b12388/2026-10/AP26280382243949.jpeg\"/><p>非洲剛果民主共和國政府昨日公布的數據顯示，自本年5月宣布疫情爆發以來，境內伊波拉確診病例已突破1萬宗，累計1萬60宗；本月23日公布的資料指出，致死率約48.6%。</p><p>有兩名在東部宣傳伊波拉疫情防治的社區衛生工作人員，近日遭民眾指控散播病毒，隨後受到攻擊，造成1死1傷。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T00:40:37.679300+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T00:25:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:41.924228+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T00:38:30.705130+00:00","content_hash":"d197bd38b8a70c6fc34860b05329c8b78a1495211a7d6f6fd17a26794364550a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}